                            "coffeehouse"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5892cd0f-8965-4bb8-a11c-b6ba7f222bfc",
                                "sense_id": "2f02a016-ed15-3ea0-b13f-343d161b843d",
                                "text": "Их можно всегда было видеть в кофейнях полутурецкой Бессарабии, с длинными чубуками во рту, прихлёбывающих кофейную гущу из маленьких чашечек.",
                                "translation": "They could always be seen in the coffee-houses of half Turkish Bessarabia, with long pipes in their mouths, sipping coffee grounds out of small cups.",
                                "english": "They could always be seen in the coffee-houses of half Turkish Bessarabia, with long pipes in their mouths, sipping coffee grounds out of small cups."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
